title portrait and square recorder, every meter lamp off: MON (monitor off), LIM, LOW CUT grey dots with dimmed labels, PEAK dark
sizes 320x480 480x800 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MONITOR off
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LIM off
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LOWCUT off
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot lamp-h-all-off
expect text "MON"
expect text "LIM"
expect text "PEAK"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
